     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Hi!",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " what about a command line switch in the migration utils to run the migration without actually create the files and directories? A sort of dry run. The log would have all the info to plan the migration for the storage part, and also a lot of hints on what to fix before running the migration.",
       "type": "text"
      }
